{"steam_appid":4782240,"steam_name":"Dog Man: Bark in Action","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4782240/1211614360/afc68d981cea6dde338bce010f08a1a89250cc70/1790258645/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790259014","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257432685/6356f648ee87abdcdc586fb0b61cf16539747dc1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790259014","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/1447879b20af8140b6f007908f5d81d7e162fa78/ss_1447879b20af8140b6f007908f5d81d7e162fa78.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793112681","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/e243190fa98ef07343951e8dfefef13ef9fa23af/ss_e243190fa98ef07343951e8dfefef13ef9fa23af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793112681","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/93d55b89a9125b1001932f7fc7bd32146fdbe790/ss_93d55b89a9125b1001932f7fc7bd32146fdbe790.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793112681","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/bb4d5e2f82b71d80544730c734a543948a2a9e97/ss_bb4d5e2f82b71d80544730c734a543948a2a9e97.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793112681","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/7d8cb85677fc243e2a2b745066e786200fdebf84/ss_7d8cb85677fc243e2a2b745066e786200fdebf84.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793112681"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Dog Man and his Supa Buddies for a supa-new adventure!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/69d68fd688270d70ea6232c7eeb11302.poster.avif?t=1793112681\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/69d68fd688270d70ea6232c7eeb11302.webm?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/69d68fd688270d70ea6232c7eeb11302.mp4?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comic-book style game packed with action, humor, boss fights, and ability-granting gadgets. Play as 10 different characters from the comics, each with unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hero is needed! Dr. Scum has set up Hypno Screens around the city, mind-controlling the innocent townsfolk. Now it’s up to Dog Man - part Dog, part Man- to fight back against Dr. Scum and all his minions. Defeat Dr. Scum, save your friends, and rescue the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game based on the wonderful Dog Man comic books by artist Dav Pilkey, also known for Captain Underpants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bark in Action Features:</strong>  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work Together with the Supa Buddies</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Dog Man and his Supa Buddies: Dog Man, Li'l Petey, 80-HD. Each has their own special abilities, to overcome obstacles and defeat Dr. Scum.  Phone in Friends to help you, like Commander Cupcake or Chief, for a total of 10 playable characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/b16d728340b33de9beddebfc154bbff9.poster.avif?t=1793112681\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/b16d728340b33de9beddebfc154bbff9.webm?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/b16d728340b33de9beddebfc154bbff9.mp4?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore 60 Action Packed Levels</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore iconic locations from the Dog Man universe, such as the Cat Jail and Robo-Time Industries. Beat the clock in the Time Challenges, and discover the Mystery Levels full of surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/5890921ee1cf9248aaee8fe03ea1dbdb.poster.avif?t=1793112681\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/5890921ee1cf9248aaee8fe03ea1dbdb.webm?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/5890921ee1cf9248aaee8fe03ea1dbdb.mp4?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo or with a Friend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the action by having a second player join with unique special abilities. Couch co-op the whole family can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/d6293db5f77d460424730e126ee53f0b.poster.avif?t=1793112681\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/d6293db5f77d460424730e126ee53f0b.webm?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/d6293db5f77d460424730e126ee53f0b.mp4?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Unlockable Outfits and Supa Gadgets</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sprockets to unlock crazy Gadgets. Collect yarn to craft cool new outfits like the Scarlet Shedder, Cat Kid and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/c5127d919cb2801fb8f8468e60cbefa7.poster.avif?t=1793112681\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/c5127d919cb2801fb8f8468e60cbefa7.webm?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782240/extras/c5127d919cb2801fb8f8468e60cbefa7.mp4?t=1793112681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stand up to Villains</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each character's signature fighting move to take down Dr. Scum's minions and the Supa-Bad-Guy himself. Use clever teamwork to beat bosses! </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5257U, AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050, AMD RX 460 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5257U, AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050, AMD RX 460 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"developers":["Floor 84"],"publishers":["Mindscape"],"release_date":"Oct 27, 2026"}